{"h":2857,"w":2400,"lines":[{"w":0.052439521153767904,"c":1,"y":0.057434033192656386,"x":0.081046675326767709,"t":"Test 4","h":0.01594588704839961},{"h":0.017528317039708585,"c":1,"w":0.67301035563151046,"y":0.10601819486519348,"x":0.077854683684968742,"t":"In 2014, Nigerian academics announced they had got better yields of biofuel gas"},{"y":0.12491252596047353,"c":1,"x":0.079584785558580312,"t":"when they mixed the plant with chicken manure. A few years later, Kenyan scientists","w":0.69550170898437502,"h":0.017529334781718697},{"c":1,"w":0.71107264200846354,"t":"confirmed what their Nigerian peers and others had already found: manure worked to","x":0.079584786153711021,"y":0.14240727764301531,"h":0.017494751574527623},{"y":0.16130160940438931,"t":"improve the process of converting the weed into gas.","w":0.44809687296549472,"h":0.017494751574527623,"x":0.077854677599236671,"c":1},{"t":"In 2018, the technology came to a village on the shore of Lake Victoria, called Dunga.","w":0.71107264200846354,"h":0.018932982538862664,"x":0.079584786168887547,"y":0.19909027324157058,"c":1},{"x":0.07958476965228338,"w":0.72145329793294277,"t":"The project promised a two-tor-one solution to the dual menaces of the water hyacinth","y":0.21656976720521115,"c":1,"h":0.014534884186538477},{"y":0.23401162762512007,"c":1,"t":"and dependence on firewood. The community received a pair of donated biogas","h":0.017562900246899771,"w":0.66955017089843749,"x":0.0795847760537471},{"c":1,"w":0.70934254964192711,"y":0.25145348839935455,"t":"digesters - machines that would transform a mix of water hyacinth and cow dung into","h":0.019015370923543551,"x":0.079584780500835756},{"y":0.27034883691799094,"w":0.16608996073404947,"x":0.079584777309422164,"t":"biogas for cooking.","h":0.017614773722942845,"c":1},{"w":0.69377161661783848,"c":1,"x":0.079584779835280464,"t":"The digesters work a bit like a stomach. The mixture goes in one end - think of it as","h":0.017441861023846261,"y":0.30668604622994966},{"y":0.32400279948261246,"w":0.68512110392252601,"t":"a mouth - and over the next 20 to 30 days, it goes through a fermentation process","x":0.079584776651389577,"h":0.019020456296735322,"c":1},{"y":0.3428971305781634,"w":0.70934254964192711,"h":0.019021474038745323,"x":0.079584780429960353,"c":1,"t":"and breaks down, giving off gas that comes out the other end. From there, the clean-"},{"c":1,"w":0.70429402669270835,"h":0.02263176866642147,"t":"burning gas is passed through pipes to the point of use, just like traditional domestic","x":0.079511479936564905,"y":0.35906787815698027},{"x":0.07958478301212106,"w":0.70242212931315107,"c":1,"y":0.38068579410402592,"h":0.01902350818802212,"t":"gas. In Dunga, the machines produce enough gas to serve about 60% of the village's"},{"t":"population. It is used in domestic stoves and for other household tasks such as","y":0.39524294330668053,"w":0.65062520345052077,"h":0.020742344305680449,"c":1,"x":0.079526067510020892},{"y":0.41707487723629888,"x":0.079584772055936337,"w":0.31833910624186196,"t":"puritying water and incubating chicks.","c":1,"h":0.017518146293325154},{"h":0.017494751574527623,"w":0.70588236490885414,"t":"The project is testing whether biogas can provide an effective alternative to firewood","y":0.45346396068544625,"x":0.079584769016161086,"c":1},{"t":"and charcoal in rural Kenyan communities. Results indicate that the programme seems","y":0.47093023227499931,"h":0.017523231666516814,"w":0.71453287760416662,"x":0.07958477212640569,"c":1},{"h":0.018975703010532419,"c":1,"y":0.48837209281810456,"t":"to be working. The women who smoke the lake fish are already getting sick less often.","w":0.71626296997070305,"x":0.079584783050980545},{"y":0.50726744188648032,"h":0.018974685268522307,"w":0.67301035563151035,"c":1,"x":0.081314891224129257,"t":"Besides, they don't have to devote a lot of time every day to gathering firewood,"},{"c":1,"h":0.023574583508736424,"x":0.079495239565809658,"y":0.52283598715519519,"t":"which is a great relief. As a result, they're able to make more money for their families","w":0.70259765625000004},{"t":"from other enterprises.","c":1,"h":0.017573071660655137,"y":0.54505813924614133,"w":0.1955017344156901,"x":0.079584772827315103},{"w":0.68339101155598958,"h":0.01744186102384615,"y":0.58139534855553732,"c":1,"x":0.081314874754904634,"t":"Kanyiva Muindi is an epidemiologist and air pollution research fellow at the African"},{"h":0.017608671275112786,"t":"Population and Health Research Centre in Nairobi. She says families who switch to the","x":0.081314870270964165,"y":0.59867039876914396,"w":0.71280278523763019,"c":1},{"h":0.020753880494787103,"y":0.61602592201706019,"t":"smokeless cooking method could expect fewer respiratory diseases. Women, young","w":0.69561930338541667,"x":0.079532217239883685,"c":1},{"y":0.63645906229467186,"x":0.079584781070977897,"h":0.017610705424389472,"c":1,"t":"girls and children are particularly vulnerable because they are the ones who cook in the","w":0.72491348266601563},{"t":"kitchen or outside over fires.","h":0.020192711565192534,"y":0.65145068727206823,"c":1,"x":0.079401459072157218,"w":0.2409483591715495},{"t":"How much better the biogas stoves will be for the community's health still needs more","y":0.69034289742073396,"w":0.71453287760416662,"h":0.017505940062921277,"x":0.081314876076312242,"c":1},{"w":0.70415227254231771,"c":1,"y":0.70923722851851589,"t":"research, says Dominic Kahumbu Wanjihia, Biogas International's chief executive. But","h":0.0175069578049315,"x":0.079584763302098238},{"x":0.081270158372338891,"y":0.72645976798790612,"h":0.02010869212380817,"c":1,"t":"unless the price of the machines drops, it's pretty clear that most communities will","w":0.67828781127929694},{"t":"never be able to afford any, since they sell for about $750.","w":0.48442906697591148,"y":0.74562631227190013,"x":0.081314878226368043,"c":1,"h":0.018908571412798558},{"h":0.017533403080272181,"c":1,"y":0.78197674390451222,"t":"Kanyiva says affordability is a challenge worth addressing, given the huge health and","w":0.69896194458007821,"x":0.081314875374320833},{"h":0.022455441025773348,"w":0.70429306030273442,"x":0.08123767350071015,"y":0.79815858815420715,"c":1,"t":"environmental dangers posed by 'dirty' fuels such as wood, charcoal and kerosene. If"},{"c":1,"y":0.81831395351601421,"t":"biogas could become affordable on a large scale, she says it 'would be life-changing","x":0.08131486968528065,"w":0.69723185221354167,"h":0.018984856682277562},{"c":1,"t":"for millions on the African continent and beyond'.","x":0.079584774470909891,"y":0.83720930204250543,"w":0.41522491455078131,"h":0.017584260149048792},{"x":0.079584775455446691,"c":1,"y":0.95639534890686573,"h":0.01308139510051276,"w":0.022491348584493004,"t":"82"}]}